  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fair Water Footprints</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Fair Water Footprints workstream supports systemic change in nature-positive, pro-vulnerable global financial flows by engaging with the private sector to build understanding of water risk in their supply chains and providing mechanisms for systemic learning, leadership, and accountability for robust analysis of water footprints throughout key supply chains.</narrative>
  </description>
